       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           SFRTMCHRTD.
       AUTHOR.               KALMAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         JUNE 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*     THIS IS AN ONLINE PROGRAM THAT WILL ALLOW THE USER
      *D*     TO MATCH MANUAL FREIGHT BILLS TO RATED BILLS.
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.
      *C*
      *C* OCT 27, 1993     CR KALMAN
      *C* ANY SUBFILE CHARGES FIELD THAT IS NOT BIG ENOUGH
      *C* TO HOLD THE ENTIRE CHARGE AMOUNT WILL APPEAR IN
      *C* INVERSE VIDEO.  THE ACTUAL AMOUNT CAN BE SEEN BY
      *C* DOING AN INQUIRY ON THE INDIVIDUAL FREIGHT BILL.
      *C*
      *C* MAY 22, 1996       CA YODER
      *C* INCREASED SIZE OF SUBFILE.  ORIGINALLY, 1000 RECORDS WERE
      *C* PROVIDED FOR, BUT IT WAS INCREASED TO 4000 RECORDS BECAUSE
      *C* FREQUENT BLOW-UPS WERE RECORDED DUE TO THE SUBFILE SIZE.
      *C*
      *C* ALSO CORRECTED PAGING LOGIC.  AN ERROR WOULD OCCUR WHEN 1->
      *C* NO MORE MANUALS WERE FOUND IN LIST-REC PARAGRAPHS, 2-> THE
      *C* LAST ONE FOUND IS THE 7TH ENTRY ON THE SCREEN (SUBFILE
      *C* SIZE PER PAGE), AND 3-> DAPPLFRT-EOF WAS NOT ENCOUNTERED
      *C* ON THAT 7TH ENTRY LAST FOUND.  WHEN THIS SITUATION OCCURS,
      *C* THE PAGING COUNTERS ARE RESET TO THE VALUES THAT EXISTED
      *C* BEFORE THEY WERE INCREMENTED FOR PERFORMING 600-LIST-ALL-
      *C* RECS.  THIS ELIMINATES THE ERROR OF READING PAST THE SUBFILE
      *C* EOF WHEN THE PAGE DOWN KEY IS USED.
      *C*
      *C*   01/08/2004    CA YODER
      *C*     INCREASED RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER FIELD SIZE FROM 4 TO 5.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZFREIGHT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS SUBFILE-IX
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPCA1100
                  ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS DAPPLFRT-IX
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-PO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1103
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA1105
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCA0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(1000).

       FD  DAPPLFRT-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFPCA1100.

       FD  DAPPLFRT-PO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-PO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1101.

       FD  DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1103.

       FD  DAPPLFRT-VS-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DAPPLFRT-VS-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA1100  OF MCFLCA1105.

       FD  MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCA0100  OF MCFLCA0101.

      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
