       01  WS-CONTROL.
           05  FUNCTION-KEY       PIC XX.
               88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00".
               88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01".
               88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02".
               88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03".
               88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04".
               88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05".
               88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06".
               88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07".
               88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08".
               88  F9-KEY-USED                          VALUE "09".
               88  F10-KEY-USED                         VALUE "10".
               88  F11-KEY-USED                         VALUE "11".
               88  F12-KEY-USED                         VALUE "12".
               88  ROLLUP-KEY-USED                      VALUE "RU".
           05  TERMINAL-ID        PIC X(10).
           05  FORMAT-NAME        PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS         PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND                PIC 1
                                  OCCURS 99 TIMES
                                  INDICATOR 1.
               88  IND-OFF        VALUE B"0".
               88  IND-ON         VALUE B"1".

       01  OFF-SWITCH             PIC 1  VALUE B"0".
       01  ON-SWITCH              PIC 1  VALUE B"1".

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  DAPPLFRT-IX            PIC 9(5) COMP-4.

       01  RTN-CODE               PIC 9.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DAPPLFRT-IX, RTN-CODE.
      ******************************************************************

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       MAIN SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       0-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 1-HSK.

           PERFORM 6-LOOP THRU 6-LOOP-X.

           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT      DAPPLFRT-PCP-I      MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
                           DAPPLFRT-PO-I
                           DAPPLFRT-VS-I.
           OPEN I-O        DISPLAY-FILE        DAPPLFRT-O.

      *----AS OF MAR 93 THE CENTURY IS NOT AVAILABLE FROM THE SYSTEM.
      *----UNTIL THE SITUATION CHANGES, THE FOLLOWING CODING IS A
      *----TEMPORARY MEASURE. THIS CODING IS USED FOR ALL DATES IN
      *----THIS PROGRAM THAT NEED CONVERSION.

           ACCEPT CUR-SYSTEM-DATE FROM DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY < "40"
              MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC.

      *----GET ACCOUNTING MONTH END DATE AND AVG COST FLAG.

           MOVE "MTED" TO MACCT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I.
           MOVE MACCT-AVG-COST-CALC-SW TO SAVE-AVG-COST-CALC-SW.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-TIME TO SAVE-MONTH-END-TIME.
           MOVE MACCT-MONTH-END-DATE TO SAVE-ME-DATE-YMD.
           IF SAVE-ME-DATE-YY < "40"
              MOVE "20" TO SAVE-ME-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO SAVE-ME-DATE-CC.
           MOVE MACCT-PAY-FRT-TAX TO SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX.

           MOVE "3" TO REC-LIST-OPTION.
           MOVE "1" TO FKEY-LIST-OPTION.
           MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC.
           INITIALIZE FRT-REC-APPLIED.

      *----SAVE MANUAL'S REC NUMBER FOR FUTURE USE.

           MOVE DAPPLFRT-IX TO RTD-DAPPLFRT-IX.

       2-EOJ.

           CLOSE   DAPPLFRT-PCP-I      MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I
                   DAPPLFRT-PO-I       DAPPLFRT-O
                   DAPPLFRT-VS-I       DISPLAY-FILE.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       6-LOOP SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       6-FIND-LOAD-RATED.

      *----FIND DAPPLFRT-REC USING THE RELATIVE RECORD NUMBER.

           MOVE RTD-DAPPLFRT-IX TO RECNUM-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-NO-LOCK.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
              MOVE "DAPPLFRT NOT FOUND*6-FLR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DAPPLFRT-IX      TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----IF THERE IS A PAID APPLIED DATE IN THIS RECORD IT
      *----MEANS THAT THE BILL HAS ALREADY BEEN APPLIED AND THE USER
      *----IS TRYING TO APPLY IT AGAIN. SET THE FLAG TO STOP ANY
      *----FURTHER ACTIVITY.

           IF DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE > SPACES
              MOVE "Y" TO FRT-REC-APPLIED
              MOVE "3" TO FKEY-LIST-OPTION.

           IF DAPPL-PO-NUM > SPACES
              STRING DAPPL-PO-NUM   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DAPPL-PO-RLS   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DAPPL-PO-RCVR  DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO S2-PO-RCVR
           ELSE
              MOVE SPACES TO S2-PO-RCVR.

           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-PAIDDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-SHIPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR             TO S2-CAR, S2-STR-VEH.
           MOVE DAPPL-TERMS                TO S2-TERMS.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO          TO S2-PPRONUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER         TO S2-PCARR.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT             TO S2-PCHARGES.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-TAX             TO S2-PTAXES.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-APPL-DATE       TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-PCHGAPPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-PRCVDDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO         TO S2-RPRONUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER        TO S2-RCARR, S2-STR-CARR.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-AMT            TO S2-RCHARGES.

           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-APPL-DATE      TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-RCHGAPPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-RCV-DATE       TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-RRCVDDT.

           IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = SPACES
              MOVE "ACTIVE"                TO S2-STATUS.
           IF DAPPL-STATUS-1 = "X"
              MOVE "CANCELED"              TO S2-STATUS.

           MOVE DAPPL-STATUS-DATE          TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-STATDT.

      *----SAVE THE RATED RECORD BECAUSE THE SUBFILE WILL USE
      *----THE SAME BUFFER. (THE REC NUM WAS ALREADY SAVED IN 1-HSK).

           MOVE BUF-DAPPLFRT               TO BUF-RTD-DAPPLFRT.

       60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           INITIALIZE SUBFILE-IX, DAPPLFRT-EOF, SUBFILE-REC-CNT.

      *----SHOW SFLCTL (71) AND CLEAR SFL (72), BUT DON'T SHOW IT (70).
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (71)  IND (72).
           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (70).

           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "RMCHSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON INIT SFL WRITE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----TURN CLEAR SFL OFF.

           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (72).

       60A-GET-LIST.

           INITIALIZE BUF-SCREEN1, LOAD-LIMIT.
           MOVE SUBFILE-REC-CNT TO SUBFILE-IX.

      *----------------------------------------
      * LIST OPTIONS:
      *      3 = LIST BY PAID CARRIER/PRO NO
      *      5 = LIST BY CAR/SHIP DT
      *----------------------------------------

           IF REC-LIST-OPTION = 3
              PERFORM 603-LIST-BY-PD-CARR-PRO.
           IF REC-LIST-OPTION = 5
              PERFORM 605-LIST-BY-CAR-SHIPDT.

           MOVE BUF-DAPPLFRT TO SAVE-BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE IO-RECNUM    TO SAVE-RECNUM.

      *------- RESET RECORD COUNTERS IF NO MORE MANUALS ARE FOUND
      *------- AND THE LAST ONE FOUND IS IN THE 7TH ENTRY ON THE
      *------- SCREEN.
           IF S2-DSPREC > SUBFILE-REC-CNT
               SUBTRACT 1 FROM S2-DSPREC
               IF SUBFILE-IX > 0
                   SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUBFILE-IX.

       61-SHOW-SCREEN.

      *----PUT UP CORRECT FUNCTION KEY SCREEN.

           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "1"
              WRITE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN3
                    FORMAT IS "RMCHFKEY1"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.

           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "2"
              WRITE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN3
                    FORMAT IS "RMCHFKEY2"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.

           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "3"
              WRITE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN3
                    FORMAT IS "RMCHFKEY3"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.

           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

      *----OVERLAY WITH SFLCTL AND SFL SCREENS.

           IF SUBFILE-IX = ZERO
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (70)
           ELSE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (70).
           MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (71).

           IF REC-LIST-OPTION  = "3"  MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (03).
           IF REC-LIST-OPTION  = "5"  MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (05).

           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "1"  MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (20)
                                      MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (21).
           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "2"  MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (20)
                                      MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (21).
           IF FKEY-LIST-OPTION = "3"  MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (20)
                                      MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (21).

           IF FRT-REC-APPLIED = "Y"
              MOVE "APPLIED" TO S2-APPLMSG
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND(10).

           IF DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y"
              MOVE ON-SWITCH  TO IND (73)
           ELSE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (73).

           IF SEARCH-TOGGLE = "Y"
              MOVE "N" TO SEARCH-TOGGLE
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO IND (30).

           WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "RMCHSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON SHOW SFL WRITE" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DISPLAY-STATUS TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

      *----READ USER INPUT.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE INTO BUF-SCREEN2
              FORMAT IS "RMCHSFLCTL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF IND-ON (75)
              SET ROLLUP-KEY-USED TO TRUE.
           MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.
           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "PROBLEM ON READ SFL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       62-ACTION.

            IF ROLLUP-KEY-USED
               COMPUTE S2-DSPREC = SUBFILE-REC-CNT + 1
               MOVE SAVE-BUF-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT
               MOVE SAVE-RECNUM       TO IO-RECNUM
               GO TO 60A-GET-LIST.

           IF ENTER-KEY-USED
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F2-KEY-USED
              PERFORM 621-CALL-SFRTINQ
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F3-KEY-USED
              EVALUATE FKEY-LIST-OPTION
                 WHEN "1"
                    IF FRT-REC-APPLIED = "Y"
                       MOVE 0 TO RTN-CODE
                    ELSE
                       MOVE 1 TO RTN-CODE
                    END-IF
                    GO TO 6-LOOP-X
                 WHEN "2"
                    PERFORM 620-EXIT-APPLY-CANCEL-SCREEN
                    PERFORM 6-FIND-LOAD-RATED
                    GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN
                 WHEN "3"
                    MOVE 0 TO RTN-CODE
                    GO TO 6-LOOP-X.

           IF F5-KEY-USED
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              INITIALIZE S2-STR-CARR,  S2-STR-PRO,  S2-STR-VEH
              MOVE RTD-DAPPLFRT-IX TO DAPPLFRT-IX
              GO TO 6-FIND-LOAD-RATED.

           IF F6-KEY-USED
              MOVE "Y" TO SEARCH-TOGGLE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD TO S2-DSPREC
              IF S2-DSPREC = 0
                 MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC
              END-IF
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F7-KEY-USED
              EVALUATE FKEY-LIST-OPTION
                 WHEN "1"
                    PERFORM 624-MATCH
                    GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN
                 WHEN "2"
                    PERFORM 625-APPLY
                    PERFORM 620-EXIT-APPLY-CANCEL-SCREEN
                    GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF F10-KEY-USED
              MOVE "3" TO REC-LIST-OPTION
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

           IF F12-KEY-USED
              MOVE "5" TO REC-LIST-OPTION
              MOVE  1  TO S2-DSPREC
              GO TO 60-LOAD-SCREEN.

       603-LIST-BY-PD-CARR-PRO.

           IF NOT ROLLUP-KEY-USED
              MOVE S2-STR-CARR  TO CARRIER-ARG
              MOVE S2-STR-PRO   TO PRO-NO-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-PCP
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                 MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
              END-IF
              IF DAPPLFRT-EOF NOT = "Y"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
                 ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

           PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y" OR LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE > SPACES
                AND DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER   TO S1-CARRIER
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO    TO S1-PRONUM
                 MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR       TO S1-CAR
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE         TO S1-SHIPDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT       TO S1-CHARGES
9310CK           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT > 9999.99
  .                 MOVE "Y"              TO S1-TRUNC
  .              ELSE
  .                 MOVE "N"              TO S1-TRUNC
9310CK           END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE         TO S1-PAIDDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-STATUS-1       TO S1-STAT
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM            TO S1-RECNUM
                 ADD 1 TO SUBFILE-IX, SUBFILE-REC-CNT, LOAD-LIMIT
                 IF SUBFILE-IX > 4000
                    MOVE "SUBFILE TOO SMALL-INCREASE RMCHSFL/ZFREIGHT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "PROBLEM ON LOAD SFL WRITE -- #1"
                                                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    MOVE S1-CARRIER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                    MOVE S1-PRONUM  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I
              ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
           END-PERFORM.

       605-LIST-BY-CAR-SHIPDT.

           IF NOT ROLLUP-KEY-USED
              MOVE S2-STR-VEH   TO RAIL-CAR-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-VS
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                 MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF
              END-IF
              IF DAPPLFRT-EOF NOT = "Y"
                 PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
                 ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

           PERFORM UNTIL DAPPLFRT-EOF = "Y" OR LOAD-LIMIT-REACHED
              IF DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE > SPACES
                AND DAPPL-PO-13 = SPACES
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER   TO S1-CARRIER
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO    TO S1-PRONUM
                 MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR       TO S1-CAR
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE         TO S1-SHIPDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT       TO S1-CHARGES
9310CK           IF DAPPL-PAID-AMT > 9999.99
  .                 MOVE "Y"              TO S1-TRUNC
  .              ELSE
  .                 MOVE "N"              TO S1-TRUNC
9310CK           END-IF
                 MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE (3:6) TO DATE-ARG
                 PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
                 MOVE CONVERT-DATE         TO S1-PAIDDT
                 MOVE DAPPL-STATUS-1       TO S1-STAT
                 MOVE IO-RECNUM            TO S1-RECNUM
                 ADD 1 TO SUBFILE-IX, SUBFILE-REC-CNT, LOAD-LIMIT
                 IF SUBFILE-IX > 4000
                    MOVE "SUBFILE TOO SMALL-INCREASE RMCHSFL/ZFREIGHT"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
                 IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                    MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
                 ELSE
                    MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 END-IF
                 WRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                    FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
                    INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 END-WRITE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
                 IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
                    MOVE "PROBLEM ON LOAD SFL WRITE -- #2"
                                                     TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                    MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                    MOVE S1-CARRIER TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                    MOVE S1-PRONUM  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
                    GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I
              ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
           END-PERFORM.


       620-EXIT-APPLY-CANCEL-SCREEN.

      *----THE MATCH WAS EITHER APPLIED (F7) OR CANCELED (F3).
      *----IF THE MATCH WAS CANCELLED, RESET FKEYS TO FULL CAPABILITY.
      *----IF THE MATCH WAS APPLIED, RESET FKEYS TO ALLOW EXIT ONLY.
      *----IN BOTH CASES, UPDATE SUBFILE REC.

           MOVE S2-DSPREC TO SUBFILE-IX.
           READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE
                INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL".
           INITIALIZE S1-OPTION.
           IF F7-KEY-USED
              MOVE "7A" TO S1-ACTION
              MOVE "3"  TO FKEY-LIST-OPTION.
           IF F3-KEY-USED
              MOVE "7C" TO S1-ACTION
              MOVE "1"  TO FKEY-LIST-OPTION.
           IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
           ELSE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40).
           REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
              FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40).

       621-CALL-SFRTINQ.

      *----FIND FIRST SUBFILE REC TO INQUIRE.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
           END-PERFORM

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

           INITIALIZE RTN-CODE.

           PERFORM UNTIL DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO

              CALL "SFRTINQ" USING S1-RECNUM, RTN-CODE,
                                   BU-DISPLAY-MSG, BU-DISPLAY-FLDS

              IF RTN-CODE NOT = 0
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP
              END-IF

      *-------UPDATE THE SUBFILE RECORD

              MOVE "2" TO S1-ACTION
              INITIALIZE S1-OPTION

              IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
                 MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
              ELSE
                 MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)
              END-IF
              REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
                 FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
                 INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
                 INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
              END-REWRITE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40)

      *-------GET NEXT SUBFILE RECORD TO INQUIRE

              PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
                 READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                      INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                      FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
                 END-READ
              END-PERFORM

           END-PERFORM.

       624-MATCH.

      *----FIND SUBFILE REC TO MATCH.

           PERFORM UNTIL S1-OPTION = "X" OR DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              READ SUBFILE DISPLAY-FILE NEXT MODIFIED RECORD
                   INTO BUF-SCREEN1
                   FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
           END-PERFORM

           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = ZERO
              GO TO 61-SHOW-SCREEN.

           IF S1-OPTION = "X"
              MOVE SUBFILE-IX TO S2-DSPREC
           ELSE
              MOVE S2-RELRCD TO S2-DSPREC.
           IF S2-DSPREC < 1
              MOVE 1 TO S2-DSPREC.

           INITIALIZE DAPPLFRT-EOF.

      *----FIND THE RECORD IN DAPPLFRT

           MOVE S1-RECNUM TO RECNUM-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-NO-LOCK.

      *----SAVE THE BUFFER IN CASE THIS MATCHED REC SHOULD BE APPLIED.

           MOVE BUF-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-MNL-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO MNL-DAPPLFRT-IX.

      *----UPDATE THE SFLCTL RECORD

           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE        TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-PAIDDT.

           IF DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE NOT = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE        TO DATE-ARG
              PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE
              MOVE CONVERT-DATE               TO S2-SHIPDT.

           MOVE S1-CAR     TO S2-CAR.
           MOVE DAPPL-TERMS TO S2-TERMS.

           IF S1-CARRIER = SPACES
              MOVE S2-RCARR TO S2-PCARR
           ELSE
              MOVE S1-CARRIER TO S2-PCARR.

           IF S1-PRONUM = SPACES
              MOVE S2-RPRONUM TO S2-PPRONUM
           ELSE
              MOVE S1-PRONUM TO S2-PPRONUM.

9310CK*----USE THE BUFFER PAID AMT IN CASE THE SCREEN AMT GOT TRUNC.
9310CK     MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT TO S2-PCHARGES.

           MOVE CUR-DATE TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE TO S2-PCHGAPPDT.

           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE TO DATE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           MOVE CONVERT-DATE TO S2-PRCVDDT.

      *----UPDATE THE SFL RECORD

           MOVE "7M" TO S1-ACTION.

           IF S1-TRUNC = "Y"
              MOVE ON-SWITCH TO  IND (40)
           ELSE
              MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40).
           REWRITE SUBFILE DISPLAY-REC FROM BUF-SCREEN1
              FORMAT IS "RMCHSFL"
              INDICATORS ARE SRF-INDICATORS
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           MOVE OFF-SWITCH TO IND (40).

      *----PREPARE TO SHOW SFLCTL WITH NEW FKEYS THAT WILL BE USED
      *----FOR 625-APPLY PAR.

           MOVE "2" TO FKEY-LIST-OPTION.

       625-APPLY.

      *----USE THE 2 DAPPLFRT BUFFERS (MNL & RTD) TO CREATE THE
      *----FREIGHT BUFFER AND OTHER PARMS BEFORE CALLING SFRTAPPLY.

           MOVE "02"                   TO FREIGHT-TRAN-CODE.
           MOVE "P"                    TO FREIGHT-REC-TYPE.
           INITIALIZE                     FREIGHT-MODE-CODE.

           MOVE BUF-MNL-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO      TO FREIGHT-FB-NUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE    TO FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR         TO FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER     TO FREIGHT-PAY-CARR.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT         TO FREIGHT-CHARGES,
                                          PAID-AMT
                                          AMT-TO-APPLY.
           MOVE DAPPL-TIS-PAID-DATE    TO FREIGHT-PAID-DATE.
           MOVE DAPPL-TERMS            TO FREIGHT-TERMS.

           MOVE BUF-RTD-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE DAPPL-PO-14            TO FREIGHT-PO-14.
           IF FREIGHT-FB-NUM      = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-RATED-PRO-NO  TO FREIGHT-FB-NUM.
           IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE   = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE TO FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE.
           IF FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR      TO FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM.
           MOVE DAPPL-RATED-CARRIER    TO FREIGHT-DELV-CARR.
           IF FREIGHT-TERMS       = SPACES
              MOVE DAPPL-TERMS         TO FREIGHT-TERMS.
           SUBTRACT DAPPL-RATED-AMT FROM AMT-TO-APPLY.

           INITIALIZE                  TAXES-PAID.

           MOVE "SFRTMCHRTD"        TO FROM-PGM-NAME.

           IF SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX = "Y"
              IF AMT-TO-APPLY = ZERO AND PAID-AMT = ZERO
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                  PAID-AMT, TAXES-PAID, FROM-PGM-NAME.

           IF SAVE-PAY-FRT-TAX NOT = "Y"
              IF AMT-TO-APPLY = ZERO
                 CONTINUE
              ELSE
                 CALL "SFRTAPPLY" USING BUF-FREIGHT, AMT-TO-APPLY,
                                  PAID-AMT, TAXES-PAID, FROM-PGM-NAME.

      *----USE THE RATED DAPPLFRT BUF AS A BASIS TO BUILD THE COMPLETED
      *----DAPPLFRT REC. ADD INFORMATION FROM THE MANUAL DAPPLFRT BUF AND
      *----THE FREIGHT BUF CREATED ABOVE.

           MOVE RTD-DAPPLFRT-IX TO RECNUM-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O.
           MOVE BUF-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-BUILD-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE BUF-MNL-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT.

           MOVE FREIGHT-PAID-DATE     TO BLD-TIS-PAID-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE     TO BLD-TIS-SHIP-DATE.
           MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM   TO BLD-RAIL-CAR.
           MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS         TO BLD-TERMS.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-RCV-DATE   TO BLD-PAID-RCV-DATE.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-CARRIER    TO BLD-PAID-CARRIER.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-PRO-NO     TO BLD-PAID-PRO-NO.
           MOVE DAPPL-PAID-AMT        TO BLD-PAID-AMT.
           MOVE TAXES-PAID            TO BLD-PAID-TAX.
           MOVE CUR-DATE              TO BLD-PAID-APPL-DATE.
           ACCEPT CUR-TIME FROM TIME.
           MOVE CUR-TIME              TO BLD-PAID-APPL-TIME.

      *----WRITE OVER THE OLD RATED DAPPLFRT REC WITH THE NEWLY
      *----BUILT COMPLETED DAPPLFRT REC.

           MOVE BUF-BUILD-DAPPLFRT TO BUF-DAPPLFRT.
           MOVE RTD-DAPPLFRT-IX TO RECNUM-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-O.

      *----DELETE THE MANUAL DAPPLFRT REC SINCE ITS INFORMATION HAS
      *----BEEN MOVED TO THE NEWLY BUILT DAPPLFRT REC.

           MOVE MNL-DAPPLFRT-IX TO RECNUM-ARG.
           PERFORM 9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O.
           PERFORM 9999-DELETE-DAPPLFRT-O.

           MOVE "Y" TO FRT-REC-APPLIED.
           CALL "SFRTSTAMP".

       6-LOOP-X.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       9999-UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       9999-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "SFRTMCHRTD" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
              VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
              BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       9999-CONVERT-DATE.
           INITIALIZE CONVERT-DATE, FLD-LEN.
           INSPECT DATE-ARG TALLYING FLD-LEN
              FOR CHARACTERS BEFORE INITIAL SPACE.
           IF FLD-LEN = 8
              STRING DATE-ARG (1:4) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (5:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (7:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                     INTO CONVERT-DATE.
           IF FLD-LEN = 6
              STRING DATE-ARG (1:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (3:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     "-"            DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                     DATE-ARG (5:2) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                     INTO CONVERT-DATE.
           IF FLD-LEN = 0
              MOVE SPACES TO CONVERT-DATE.

       9999-WRITE-SCREEN.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
      *??? MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

       9999-READ-SCREEN.
           READ  DISPLAY-FILE FORMAT IS VIEW-NFNAME
              INDIC ARE SRF-INDICATORS.
      *??? MOVE ALL B"0" TO SRF-INDICATORS.

      *--- A BAD STATUS MAY MEAN USER TURNED OFF TERMINAL.
      *--- IF SO, SIMULATE THE F3 KEY TO EXIT PROGRAM.

           IF DISPLAY-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "03" TO FUNCTION-KEY.

       9999-CATREAD.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.

      *---------------------------------
      * DAPPLFRT
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO DAPPLFRT-IX.
           READ DAPPLFRT-O INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ DAPPLFRT*9999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-DAPPLFRT-O-NO-LOCK.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO DAPPLFRT-IX.
           READ DAPPLFRT-O INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
                WITH NO LOCK
                INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ DAPPLFRT*9999-RDONL" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DAPPLFRT-IX     TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-REWRITE-DAPPLFRT-O.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO DAPPLFRT-IX.
           REWRITE DAPPLFRT-REC-O FROM BUF-DAPPLFRT
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "REWRITE DAPPLFRT*9999-RDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE DAPPL-PO-14 TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              MOVE DAPPL-TIS-SHIP-DATE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
              MOVE DAPPL-RAIL-CAR TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
              MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (4)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-DELETE-DAPPLFRT-O.
           MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO DAPPLFRT-IX.
           DELETE DAPPLFRT-O
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "DLT OF RATED REC DIDN'T WORK" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE RECNUM-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-VS.
           MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO FRTRAILCAR OF DAPPLFRT-VS-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-VS-I KEY >= FRTRAILCAR OF DAPPLFRT-VS-REC-I
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-VS*9999-SDIGV" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE RAIL-CAR-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-VS-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-VS-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.

       9999-START-DAPPLFRT-I-GE-PCP.
           MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO PDCARRIER OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO PDPRONO   OF DAPPLFRT-PCP-REC-I.
           START DAPPLFRT-PCP-I KEY >= EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
                 MOVE "START DAPPLFRT-PCP*9999-SDIGP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 MOVE CARRIER-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 MOVE PRO-NO-ARG  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
                 GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

       9999-READ-NEXT-DAPPLFRT-PCP-I.
           READ DAPPLFRT-PCP-I NEXT INTO BUF-DAPPLFRT
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO DAPPLFRT-EOF.

      *---------------------------------
      * MACCOUNT-INFO
      *---------------------------------

       9999-READ-MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I.
           MOVE MACCT-ARG TO INFOKEY OF MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-REC-I.
           READ MACCOUNT-INFO-KEY-I INTO BUF-MACCT-INFO
              INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
              MOVE "READ MACCOUNT-INFO*9999-RMIKO" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
              MOVE MACCT-ARG TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
              GO TO 9999-BLOWUP.

